  "created": "2026-03-09T20:37:24.073Z",
  "description": "An advanced Seq app for delivering log events to Telegram chats, supergroups, and channels with support for **forum supergroup topics** (via message_thread_id) and **silent messages** (via disable_notification).\n\t\n\t    Built on top of the latest Telegram.Bot library, extending and improving the original stdray/Seq.App.Telegram integration.\n\n        - Supports **flattening nested properties** so nested event properties (e.g. User.FirstName) are correctly resolved and rendered in the MessageTemplate.\n        - Automatically **skips appending the BaseUrl link** to the end of messages when the Seq Base URL is empty, preventing broken or empty links.\n\n        Perfect for teams using Telegram as a lightweight alerting and monitoring channel.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
